19:00\n£90.00\n60 min\n19:30\nBooked\n60 min\n20:00\n£90.00\n60 min\n20:30\n£90.00\n60 min\n21:00\n£86.00\n60 min\n21:30\n£86.00\n60 min\n22:00\n£72.00\n60 min\n17:00\n£72.00\n60 min\n17:30\n£72.00\n60 min\n18:00\n£86.00\n60 min\n18:30\n£86.00\n60 min\n19:00\n£86.00\n60 min\n19:30\n£86.00\n60 min\n20:00\n£86.00\n60 min\n20:30\n£86.00\n60 min\n21:00\n£86.00\n60 min\n21:30\n£86.00\n60 min\n22:00\n£72.00\n60 min\nLocation, Opening Hours and Prices\n Click to interact with the map\n\n Ragstone Road, Slough, London, SL1 2PU\n\nPrices\n\nAround £64.50/hour\n\nPublic Transport\n\n Slough\n\nOpening Hours\nMonday\t09:00-23:00\nTuesday\t09:00-23:00\nWednesday\t09:00-23:00\nThursday\t09:00-23:00\nFriday\t09:00-23:00\nSaturday\t09:00-23:00\nSunday\t09:00-23:00\nDescription\n\nPowerleague Slough is located in west London and boasts an incredible 5-a-side 3G astroturf pitch. Not many 5-a-side pitches in London are as well maintained and cared for as this pitch. So whether you're an experienced 5-a-side player or you're just getting into the small-sided game, this facility is definitely worth playing at. Footballs might be supplied by the facility for a small fee but we advise that you call the facility to check before your arrival. The venue is surrounded by floodlights which makes this facility perfect all year around. The lights will be turned off by the facility once all sports bookings have been completed.\nThe venue is open to the public to come and play on a one off basis. Their pay as you play system means that you can book now and play without being a member. This gives you the freedom to play a one off game without having to pay a monthly membership fee.\n\nIf public transport isn't your thing, then there are alternative travel options. The venue is easily accessible by car and free parking facilities are available on site. This also makes it the perfect facility for teams hosting home games, as it means the facility is extremely accommodating for travelling away team players.\n\nIf a one-off game isn't enough, then why not take advantage of the block booking option at Powerleague Slough? Block bookings are a great way to guarantee a weekly game and socialise with your friends. It also takes the hassle out of paying before each game and collecting money from teammates as there is a one-time payment.\n\nThe changing rooms on offer here are excellent. Well maintained and spacious changing rooms provide the perfect environment in which to prepare for your match. The venue's changing rooms provide toilets and also a communal changing area. The well-equipped changing rooms provide an additional excellence to this already outstanding sports facility.\n\nThe venue is situated near Slough. From there it is a short walk to the facility which works out well for a gentle warm down after your booking.\n\n Football Pitches\n5 a side | 3G Astroturf7 a side | 3G Astroturf\nFacilities\n floodlights changing rooms\n Address\n\nPowerleague Slough\nRagstone Road\nSlough\nSL1 2PU\n\n\nVIEW ON MAP\nREVEAL PHONE NUMBER\nMAKE A BOOKING\n Nearby Football Pitches\nLifestyle Fitness Epsom\nEpsom\n\n 17.2 miles away\n\nMallinson Sports Centre\nHighgate\n\n 19.8 miles away\n\nWatlington MUGA\nWatlington\n\n 19.8 miles away\n\nHenry Fawcett Primary School\nLondon\n\n 21.2 miles away\n\nHaberdasher's Crayford Academy\nKent\n\n 34.2 miles away\n\n",
